A description publish rewrites only the agent block. `mergeDescriptionIntoPrBody` (`src/agent/description/descriptionBodyMerge.ts`) replaces the region between `<!-- PR_AGENT_DESCRIPTION_BEGIN -->` and `<!-- PR_AGENT_DESCRIPTION_END -->` and keeps `extractUserAuthoredPrBody` intact; the write runs under `withOperationIntent` (`descriptionPrBodyOperationKey`). Size is server-owned: `resolveDescriptionWritingPolicy` derives body scale `S`/`M`/`L` and map mode `omit`/`read_first` from `fileCount`, `totalChanges`, and truncation. `submitDescriptionTool.ts` enforces at submit, not by prompt: `enforceDescriptionMapPayload` strips the map on `omit` and caps five files on `read_first`; `enforceDescriptionVisualPayload` accepts flat `visuals[]` only and routes Mermaid through `sanitizeMermaidDiagram` (ADR 0036); `enforceDescriptionTitle` shapes the title, and the title write is gated by `cfg.features.titleRewrite` (`FEATURE_TITLE_REWRITE`). Do not add a second body writer.
